<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E SEES '97 NET UP TO PLN 45 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E SEES '97 NET UP TO PLN 45 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA expects to lift its 1997 net profit to 45 million zlotys from 19.6 million in 1996, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Mostostal said its sales were likely to rise to 170 million zlotys this year from 72.7 million zlotys last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
